<title>USA: Transcontinental declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>Transcontinental declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transcontinental Realty Investors Inc said Monday it was contacted by the New York Stock Exchange regarding unusual trading activity that has been occurring recently.</p>
<p>The shares, which closed Friday at 17-3/4, were trading at 20-3/4 Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>The company said that, as a matter of policy, it does not comment on variances in the trading volume or price of its stock.</p>
</text>
